a handcrafted virtual environment.\n\n**Virtual Concerts** \n\nWatch the Cyboracle perform in stunning, custom-designed environments. A pre-recorded show you can experience anytime, alone or with others.\n\n**Live Performances**\n\nJoin real-time concert events where Nona performs as the Cyboracle. A shared experience with fellow Dreamers from around the world.\n\n**Multiplayer**\n\nExperience concerts together. Gather with your community in virtual space.\n", "short_description": "A music-driven Virtual Reality experience from the mind of Nona Hendryx. Step an imaginative world rooted in Afro-Futurism and witness the Cyboracle\u2014Nona's digital avatar\u2014perform in a bespoke, handcrafted environment. Experience pre-recorded concerts or join live performances with others. An ambitious synthesis of legendary artistry and future-forward technology that invites you to imagine another world is possible."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dreammachinevr.eyejack.dev/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "EyeJack", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dreammachinevr.eyejack.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2687655338230691"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25787350604218012"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2036699336965118"}, {"status": "PUBLI